With this change, all three of these will be picked up as a single “string” region:

```ruby
# standard
message = <<-MSG
  hello
MSG

# non-interpolated
message = <<-'MSG'
  won’t interpolate #{this}
MSG

# with a method call on the opener
message = <<-MSG.chomp
  trimmed
MSG
```
